# The deployed MediLink API's real URL (your server, reachable from a phone —
# not 127.0.0.1/localhost, which only means "this phone" to the phone itself).
# A plain IP on your LAN works for testing a debug build on a device on the
# same WiFi, e.g. http://192.168.1.50:4000 (see mobile/README.md for the
# Android cleartext-traffic note that comes with using http:// instead of
# https://). For a real release, this should be your real HTTPS domain.
MEDILINK_API_BASE_URL=https://api.example.com
